ace for either number, so we just write down 0.\n\n5. **Combine all the digits**: After performing the addition step-by-step, we get the sum as follows:.\n\n   ```.\n   367962176.\n   +388451869.\n   ---------.\n   756414045.\n   ```.\n\nSo, the sum of 367962176 and 388451869 is 756414045.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: ']]
